h Lead Resume\\\"; edited copy (changed name to \\\"Alex Morgan - Tech Lead\\\" and location to \\\"Seattle, WA\\\"); verified original remains unchanged (Alex Morgan, San Francisco, CA).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Dashboard shows 5 distinct resume variations available: Untitled Resume (created new with John Test data), Tech Lead Resume (duplicated and renamed), Software Engineer Resume, Product Designer Resume, Marketing Manager Resume. Each has different content, templates, and update dates. All can be opened, edited, renamed, duplicated, and deleted.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Searched for \\\"tech\\\" (lowercase, case-insensitive) - found only \\\"Tech Lead Resume\\\"; cleared search - all 5 resumes restored; changed sort to \\\"Oldest First\\\" - order reversed to Jan 2024 → Aug 2026; changed back to \\\"Newest First\\\" - order restored to Aug 2026 → Jan 2024.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Date filtering UI not found\", \"actual\": \"No date filter controls, date input fields, or filter buttons are present on the dashboard. The search input only filters by resume title (case-insensitive), not by creation date. Searching for a date string (e.g., \\\"Feb 25, 2024\\\") returns \\\"No resumes found\\\" rather than filtering by date.\", \"evidence\": \"Dashboard has only search (title-based) and sort (by date or title) controls. No date range picker, calendar, exact date filter, or dedicated filter UI exists.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-9\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No date validation for work/education entries\", \"actual\": \"Application accepts invalid date combinations without validation or error feedback: (1) End date before start date (Jan 2020 - Dec 2019) accepted; (2) Future end dates accepted (Dec 2027 when current date is Aug 2026); (3) Both dates in future accepted (Jun 2027 - Dec 2028). No error messages, warnings, or rejection of invalid periods.\", \"evidence\": \"Entered date range \\\"2027-06\\\" to \\\"2028-12\\\" in experience entry - both dates clearly after current date (Aug 2026) - was accepted and displayed in preview as \\\"Jun 2027 Dec 2028\\\" with no validation feedback.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Toggled \\\"I currently work here\\\" on: end-date field cleared (value=\\\"\\\") and disabled (enabled=false); preview updated from \\\"Jun 2027 Dec 2028\\\" to \\\"Jun 2027 Present\\\"; date format consistent (month/year format like \\\"Jun 2027\\\").\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Resume data not persisted after page reload\", \"actual\": \"Before reload: 5 resumes visible (Tech Lead Resume, Untitled Resume, + 3 originals). After reload: only 3 original resumes (Product Designer, Marketing Manager, Software Engineer). Created resume \\\"Untitled Resume\\\" and duplicated/renamed resume \\\"Tech Lead Resume\\\" were lost after page reload.\", \"evidence\": \"Dashboard showed 5 resumes before reload; reload reduced to 3 resumes. The \\\"Untitled Resume\\\" created during testing and \\\"Tech Lead Resume\\\" duplicated from Software Engineer Resume were not persisted.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Empty title accepted without validation\", \"actual\": \"Attempted to rename \\\"Software Engineer Resume\\\" to empty string - rename was accepted. Resume now shows empty name (\\\"\\\") in dashboard. No validation error or feedback was shown. Original title was NOT preserved as required.\", \"evidence\": \"Resume card now displays empty string as title instead of \\\"Software Engineer Resume\\\". Update timestamp changed to Aug 25, 2026 indicating the rename was persisted.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Changed 