ad\\\" and location to \\\"Seattle, WA\\\". Original Software Engineer Resume retained unchanged: name remained \\\"Alex Morgan\\\", location remained \\\"San Francisco, CA\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Renamed resume from \\\"Product Designer Resume\\\" to \\\"UX/UI Designer Portfolio\\\". Editor title updated to \\\"UX/UI Designer Portfolio\\\". Dashboard card also updated to show \\\"UX/UI Designer Portfolio\\\" (previously showed \\\"Product Designer Resume\\\").\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"In Untitled Resume (Minimal template): edited section title from \\\"Skills\\\" to \\\"Core Competencies\\\" in Sections editor. Preview immediately updated to show \\\"CORE COMPETENCIES\\\" heading (styled in uppercase per Minimal template). Custom section title persisted and displayed correctly in preview.\"}]}"
