d modified resumes are lost on page reload (only pre-existing resumes persist)\n2. **Missing Validation**: Date constraints and title validation are not enforced\n3. **Missing Feature**: Date-based filtering is not available\n\n**Recommendation**: Address data persistence as the highest priority, followed by adding validation for dates and resume titles."
